@startuml
title AnimeDex — roteamento de streams por tipo de ID (ANI-SR v1.1.0 proposta)
actor "Stremio" as Client
participant "src/main.ts\nStreamHandler" as Handler
participant "utils/stream-routing.ts" as Router
participant "scraperStream.ts\nIMDb" as Imdb
participant "scraperAnimeFireStream.ts\nID interno" as AnimeFire

Client -> Handler : stream(id, type, season?, episode?)
Handler -> Router : dispatchStream(id, adapters)
alt ID tt<digitos> ou tt<digitos>:temporada:episódio
  Router -> Imdb : scraperTorrentsStreams(streams, id, type, season, episode)
  Imdb --> Router : { streams }
else ID interno ou ID não reconhecido como IMDb
  Router -> AnimeFire : scraperAnimeFireStreams(streams, id, type, season, episode)
  AnimeFire --> Router : { streams }
end
Router --> Handler : Resultado do adaptador selecionado
Handler --> Client : { streams }
note over Handler,AnimeFire
Testes ANI-T06/07 usam adaptadores simulados.
Não comprovam rede, scraping, licença ou acesso a torrents.
end note
@enduml
